 3, with a role as the Coppertone Girl in a television commercial for the iconic suntan lotion brand.\n\nA precocious and bright child from the start, Foster began talking at 9 months and had taught herself to read by the time she was 3 years old. Despite never having taken an acting class, she dove headlong into show"
